218
00:13:08,290 --> 00:13:09,820
But Wang Lin is different.

219
00:13:10,250 --> 00:13:12,220
You must watch him closely

220
00:13:12,650 --> 00:13:14,780
and when his domain is ripe,

221
00:13:15,520 --> 00:13:17,020
