to find a secluded place to recover

289
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:46,550
and breakthrough to Late stage Soul Formation.

290
00:16:53,480 --> 00:16:54,690
Transfer shift !

291
00:16:55,240 --> 00:16:55,910
Ceng Niu,

292
00:16:56,640 --> 00:16:58,280
even if I must self-destruct my Origin Soul,

293
00:16:58,480 --> 00:16:59,880
I will send you to your death !

294
00:17:11,040 --> 00:17:12,920
What kind of formation is this !?

295
00:17:21,120 --> 00:17:22,310
Junior Sister Red Butterfly,

296
00:17:23,320 --> 00:17:25,210
I promised to help you.

297
00:17:25,750 --> 00:17:26,850
I kept

298
00:17:27,420 --> 00:17:28,550
my word...

299
00:17:29,750 --> 00:17:32,890
Far North
of the Suzaku continent

300
00:17:36,280 --> 00:17:37,810
Junior Ceng Niu,

301
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:40,680
you’ve finally arrived.

302
00:17:41,150 --> 00:17:42,850
A Soul Transformation old monster ?

303
00:17:43,150 --> 00:17:43,950
Who are you ?

304
00:17:45,650 --> 00:17:48,350
Li Yuanfeng, Suzerain of Xue Yue.

305
00:17:49,320 --> 00:17:50,950
I'm here on behalf of Red Butterfly

306
00:17:51,780 --> 00:17:53,550
to take your life.

307
00:17:55,550 --> 00:17:57,200
I heard that Xue Yue

308
00:17:57,640 --> 00:18:00,230
was forcefully raised to a rank 5 cultivation country.

309
00:18:00,320 --> 00:18:01,980
7 Soul Formation Elders

310
00:18:02,180 --> 00:18:04,410
went to Suzaku with Red Butterfly.

311
00:18:05,780 --> 00:18:07,750
By using an unorthodox technique,

312
00:18:08,780 --> 00:18:10,250
only one survived

313
00:18:11,080 --> 00:18:12,950
and reached Soul Transformation.

314
00:18:13,370 --> 00:18:15,150
I assume that’s you.

315
00:18:16,480 --> 00:18:18,570
Thanks to the opportunity given by Red Butterfly,

316
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:20,110
I had a breakthrough.

317
00:18:21,240 --> 00:18:22,750
But I cannot forget my roots...

318
00:18:23,750 --> 00:18:25,380
You severed Red Butterfly’s arm.

319
00:18:26,520 --> 00:18:27,510
And Red Butterfly

320
00:18:27,750 --> 00:18:29,980
is the hope of Xue Yue.

321
00:18:30,950 --> 00:18:32,710
For both personal and public reasons

322
00:18:33,150 --> 00:18:36,210
I will not let you live another day.

323
00:18:36,750 --> 00:18:38,950
If I face a Soul Transformation now,

324
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:40,980
I stand no chance.

325
00:18:48,120 --> 00:18:49,960
Even with my soul injured,

326
00:18:50,180 --> 00:18:51,980
I should still be able to open spatial rifts.

327
00:18:53,180 --> 00:18:54,850
I have set a formation here.

328
00:18:55,680 --> 00:18:57,050
Spatial rifts

329
00:18:57,840 --> 00:18:59,350
cannot be opened.

330
00:19:00,050 --> 00:19:01,550
Your Star Compass

331
00:19:02,280 --> 00:19:03,180
is useless.

332
00:19:06,160 --> 00:19:07,470
Oh... right,

333
00:19:07,840 --> 00:19:08,980
I forgot to tell you.

334
00:19:09,720 --> 00:19:11,580
The formation also prevents teleportation.

335
00:19:12,280 --> 00:19:12,850
This formation

336
00:19:13,550 --> 00:19:14,310
is called

337
00:19:14,580 --> 00:19:16,480
the Heaven-Sealing Formation !

338
00:19:18,840 --> 00:19:19,780
Ceng Niu,

339
00:19:20,380 --> 00:19:21,310
this time

340
00:19:21,980 --> 00:19:23,610
you have no escape.

341
00:19:27,320 --> 00:19:29,680
Still refusing to give up ?

342
00:19:35,750 --> 00:19:36,720
Sun Tai,

343
00:19:36,920 --> 00:19:37,750
come quickly !

344
00:19:46,420 --> 00:19:47,990
Another Soul Transformation ?

345
00:19:48,620 --> 00:19:49,840
Junior Ceng Niu,

346
00:19:50,550 --> 00:19:51,850
as I told you,

347
00:19:52,380 --> 00:19:53,150
today

348
00:19:53,850 --> 00:19:56,010
is the day you die.

349
00:20:20,120 --> 00:20:23,420
To let go of the consequences of my actions

350
00:20:23,420 --> 00:20:25,140
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

351
00:20:25,180 --> 00:20:27,080
like scattered ink.

352
00:20:27,960 --> 00:20:34,560
As destiny falls

353
00:20:30,800 --> 00:20:34,560
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

354
00:20:34,560 --> 00:20:42,160
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

355
00:20:37,800 --> 00:20:42,160
wither and melt into rivers.

356
00:20:42,600 --> 00:20:49,720
Who can deceive

357
00:20:45,360 --> 00:20:49,720
the law of the heavens ?

358
00:20:50,040 --> 00:20:53,040
Countless generations

359
00:20:51,320 --> 00:20:53,040
have tried before me.

360
00:20:53,330 --> 00:20:56,760
But how could I not catch my dreams

361
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:56,760
within my warm fingers ?

362
00:20:57,320 --> 00:21:00,840
You're at my side when I'm alone

363
00:21:00,840 --> 00:21:04,160
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

364
00:21:04,920 --> 00:21:08,120
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

365
00:21:08,480 --> 00:21:12,320
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

366
00:21:10,320 --> 00:21:12,320
in the streets.

367
00:21:12,480 --> 00:21:17,280
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

368
00:21:14,040 --> 00:21:17,280
Can I break the rules ?

369
00:21:17,290 --> 00:21:20,000
To run towards you !

370
00:21:20,040 --> 00:21:23,320
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

371
00:21:23,320 --> 00:21:27,960
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

372
00:21:27,960 --> 00:21:31,360
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

373
00:21:31,400 --> 00:21:36,040
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

374
00:21:36,490 --> 00:21:41,720
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

375
00:21:41,840 --> 00:21:45,640
If your soul is willing to wander,

376
00:21:45,640 --> 00:21:50,280
can I still take your hands

377
00:21:47,320 --> 00:21:50,280
and hold them tight ?

378
00:21:50,440 --> 00:21:53,360
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

379
00:21:53,360 --> 00:21:58,240
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

380
00:21:58,250 --> 00:22:01,520
I dream of destroying

381
00:22:01,680 --> 00:22:06,240
the shackles of our fate.

382
00:22:06,240 --> 00:22:10,200
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

383
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:13,000
You're the hardest to let go of.

384
00:22:13,080 --> 00:22:16,880
I want to be with you again

385
00:22:16,960 --> 00:22:20,240
so I can look in your eyes.

386
00:22:20,520 --> 00:22:25,480
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
